  {
    "index": 168,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "You can meet a lot of Pok\u00E9mon by battling\\nmany Trainers!\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 169,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Some Pok\u00E9mon tend to run away or are on\\nalert when you use the bike\u2019s bell or\\r\\nwhistle through your fingers. You may want to\\r\\napproach them while crouching.\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 170,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Trading Pok\u00E9mon with other Trainers can also\\nhelp you fill your Pok\u00E9dex.\\c\\nUsing Surprise Trade is highly recommended\\nas well.\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 171,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Some Pok\u00E9mon can be found by hatching Eggs.\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 172,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Do you fish?\\c\\nQuite a lot of Pok\u00E9mon can be found only\\nby fishing.\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 173,
    "flags": 4,
    "text": "Evolving Pok\u00E9mon is necessary to find\\nsome Pok\u00E9mon.\\c\\nThere are many ways to evolve Pok\u00E9mon,\\nsuch as using an item.\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 174,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "You\u2019re very close to completing your\\nGalar Pok\u00E9dex! Keep up the good work!\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 175,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Wow! You met all the Pok\u00E9mon and completed\\nyour Galar Pok\u00E9dex, [VAR 0100(0000)]!\\c\\nCongratulations! Well done!\\c"
  },
