  },
  {
    "index": 190,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Some people you meet on the Isle of Armor are\\nhappy to show you their Pok\u00E9mon.\\c\\nOnce you see a Pok\u00E9mon, you can check its\\nhabitat in your Pok\u00E9dex!\\c"
  },
  {
